    "body": "I agree this should be pretty safe to remove and it's worth going ahead with a spec and tests PR.\r\n\r\nOther browser status:\r\n\r\n- Mozilla https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=723008 (@pwnall already pinged that thread)\r\n- WebKit: @cdumez @rniwa thoughts on where WebKit was going with webkitdropzone? Hoping to unprefix one day, or hoping to remove?\r\n- Edge: only found https://wpdev.uservoice.com/forums/257854-microsoft-edge-developer/suggestions/6514452-dropzone-attribute (notably not on Edge platform status which usually lists all features in progress); @travisleithead @dstorey any plans to implement?",
